---
/** "This works best when" list. Same on home and /call. */
---

<div class="split">
  <div>
    <h2 data-lines>This works best when</h2>
  </div>
  <ul class="plain-list lead lead--big who-list">
    <li data-reveal>You have real clients and a real team, and nobody whose full job is marketing.</li>
    <li data-reveal>You're at the point of thinking about hiring a marketing person.</li>
    <li data-reveal>You'll give us a few hours a month on camera.</li>
    <li data-reveal>You want the company to look like what it is.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .who-list li {
    padding: 30px 0;
  }
</style>
